    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nAnnotating a property explicitly with <code>@TimeToLive</code> reads back the actual <code>TTL</code> or <code>PTTL</code> value from Redis. <code>-1</code> indicates that the object has no associated expiration.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n显式使用 <code>@TimeToLive</code> 注解标记属性时，会读取 Redis 中实际的 <code>TTL</code> 或 <code>PTTL</code> 值。<code>-1</code> 表示该对象没有关联的过期时间。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nThe keyspace notification message listener alters <code>notify-keyspace-events</code> settings in Redis, if those are not already set.\nExisting settings are not overridden, so you must set up those settings correctly (or leave them empty).\nNote that <code>CONFIG</code> is disabled on AWS ElastiCache, and enabling the listener leads to an error.\nTo work around this behavior, set the <code>keyspaceNotificationsConfigParameter</code> parameter to an empty string.\nThis prevents <code>CONFIG</code> command usage.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n如果 Redis 尚未设置，键空间通知消息监听器会修改 <code>notify-keyspace-events</code> 配置。现有设置不会被覆盖，因此您必须正确设置这些参数（或将其留空）。请注意，在 AWS ElastiCache 上已禁用 <code>CONFIG</code>，启用该监听器会导致错误。为规避此行为，请将 <code>keyspaceNotificationsConfigParameter</code> 参数设置为空字符串。这将阻止使用 <code>CONFIG</code> 命令。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n<code>@EnableKeyspaceEvents(shadowCopy = OFF)</code> disable storage of phantom copies and reduces data size within Redis. <code>RedisKeyExpiredEvent</code> will only contain the <code>id</code> of the expired key.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n<code>@EnableKeyspaceEvents(shadowCopy = OFF)</code> 可禁用幻象副本的存储，从而减少 Redis 中的数据量。<code>RedisKeyExpiredEvent</code> 将仅包含已过期键的 <code>id</code>。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
