    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nDelaying or disabling the expiry event listener startup impacts <code>RedisKeyExpiredEvent</code> publishing.\nA disabled event listener does not publish expiry events.\nA delayed startup can cause loss of events because of the delayed listener initialization.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\n延迟或禁用过期事件监听器的启动会影响 <code>RedisKeyExpiredEvent</code> 的发布。禁用的事件监听器不会发布过期事件。由于监听器初始化被延迟，可能会导致事件丢失。\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nRedis repositories rely on Pub/Sub messages for residual index cleanup.\nRedis Pub/Sub messages are not persistent.\nIf a key expires while the application is down, the expiry event is not processed, which may lead to secondary indexes containing references to the expired object.\nRedis does not allow for expiration of individual entries of a set that is used as secondary index.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nRedis 存储库依赖发布/订阅消息进行残留索引清理。\nRedis 的发布/订阅消息不具备持久性。\n如果应用程序宕机时某个键过期，该过期事件将不会被处理，这可能导致二级索引中包含对已过期对象的引用。\nRedis 不允许对用作二级索引的集合中的单个条目设置过期时间。\n</td>\n</tr>",
      "count": 1
    },
